2026-07-27T07:51:12.9149744Z i /tmp/RtmptnmrHJ/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:51:12.9150127Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:51:12.9150587Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:51:12.9151368Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:51:12.9152013Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:51:12.9152971Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:51:12.9153982Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
