2026-07-27T07:51:12.9476279Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:51:12.9865934Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:51:13.0004821Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
